world  catapult into a bucket

floor
  size      8 m
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002

catapult
  is a          catapult
  pivot height  70 cm
  arm length    1 m
  arm mass      250 g
  swings        from 0° to 45°
  spring        3.6 N·m/rad toward 100°
  damping       0.05 N·m·s/rad
  armature      0.01 kg·m²
  friction      0.3
  bounce        dead
  colour        wood

ball
  is a      sphere 5 cm radius, 100 g
  moves     freely
  rolls
  bounce    dead
  friction  0.3, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.004
  colour    orange
  rests     on catapult.scoop base, centred over catapult.scoop base

bucket
  is an           open box
  length          80 cm
  width           60 cm
  walls           45 cm
  wall thickness  2 cm
  base thickness  2 cm
  friction        0.9, spinning 0.02, rolling 0.01
  bounce          dead
  colour          grey
  on              floor, 3 m beyond ball

expect
  ball comes to rest in bucket
